{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24023","headline":"咏兴五首 解印出公府 · 白居易","name":"咏兴五首 解印出公府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"解印出公府，斗薮尘土衣。\n百吏放尔散，双鹤随我归。\n归来履道宅，下马入柴扉。\n马嘶返旧枥，鹤舞还故池。\n鸡犬何忻忻，隣里亦依依。\n年颜老去日，生计胜前时。\n有帛御冬寒，有谷防岁饥。\n饱於东方朔，乐於荣啓期。\n人生且如此，此外吾不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}